  "limitations": [
    "appraisal: FDOR posts only the current roll type; prior years by email request",
    "appraisal: No roof attributes in the bulk roll (ACT_YR_BLT/EFF_YR_BLT used as roof-age proxy)",
    "appraisal: Sale fields cover only the roll's current and prior year (2025-2026)",
    "sales: Sale dates carry year+month only (day unknown; stored as first of month)",
    "sales: Only 2025-2026 transfers; older tenure comes from the COJ parcels layer (SALESL*)",
    "geometry: 192 MB archive; centroids computed from polygons (not rooftop points)",
    "geometry: Parcels present in NAL but missing from the shapefile get no coordinates",
    "transit: No GTFS-RT; no licence text published",
    "transit: Walking distance is straight-line (haversine), not network distance",
    "water: Water view is a proximity proxy (centroid within 150 m of a mapped shoreline vertex, or parcel bbox within 30 m), not a sightline analysis; distances beyond ~1 km are not computed",
    "water: NHD lake/pond polygons below 1 ha and unnamed flowlines are excluded",
    "water: Parcel polygons are not stored; the parcel bounding box stands in for the polygon",
    "places: Brand matching by name (Starbucks); confidence varies; CDLA-Permissive 2.0",
    "places: Reading the release scans ~2.5 min of remote parquet",
    "businesses: No county filter: rows kept when principal/mailing ZIP starts with 322 or city starts with JACKSONVILLE",
